# These scripts (seed_demo_passwords.php, import_sql.php,
# seed_stock_movement_history.php) are meant to be run from the CLI only —
# `php scripts/whatever.php`. seed_demo_passwords.php in particular resets
# demo accounts (including admin@example.com) to a known password, so
# letting this folder be reachable over HTTP would let anyone log in as
# admin. Deny all web access; see also the php_sapi_name() guard added
# inside each script itself.
Require all denied
